{"message":"After-tax cost = share-based compensation cost plus the income-tax-benefit line (i.e., less the tax benefit). 2010: 18.1 + (-6.3) = 11.8; 2009: 14.6 + (-5.2) = 9.4. Percentage change = (11.8 - 9.4) / 9.4 * 100 = 25.5%.","final":{"answer":"25.5% increase","value":25.53191489361702,"unit":"percent","sources":["source:t1c1n0","source:t2c1n0","source:t1c2n0","source:t2c2n0"],"result_id":"public_document:6701df9d5151a6a1160a399e1f46ce2191072bee11ae1421feab66914edcf10a"}}